---
// src/pages/solutions/cloud-virtualization.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Cloud & Virtualization Solutions (Private Cloud, VMware Alt) | InfraHub"
  description="Escape hyperscaler lock-in and Broadcom licensing shocks. Sourcing private clouds, Vates XCP-ng, Proxmox, and Kubernetes bare-metal nodes."
  canonicalPath="/solutions/cloud-virtualization"
  ogImage="/images/og/solution.png"
  ogImageAlt="InfraHub solution family"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container hub-container">
      <div class="hub-header">
        <span class="hub-kicker">Solution family</span>
        <h1>Cloud & Virtualization</h1>
        <p class="hub-lead">
          Private cloud environments, open-source hypervisors, container platforms, and disaster recovery architectures designed to deliver sovereignty and margin control.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Hypervisor Alternative</span>
          <h2>VMware Alternatives (Vates XCP-ng)</h2>
          <p>Drop-in replacement for VMware ESXi/vCenter with enterprise delta backup, warm live migration, and zero per-core penalties.</p>
          <a href="/partners/vates" class="disc-link">Explore Vates Architecture →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Dedicated Sovereign</span>
          <h2>Private Cloud Sourcing</h2>
          <p>Isolated enterprise virtual private clouds hosted in GDPR-compliant European datacenters with dedicated hypervisor hosts.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=private-cloud" class="disc-link">Inquire Private Cloud →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Orchestration</span>
          <h2>Kubernetes & Containers</h2>
          <p>Deploy production-ready bare-metal Kubernetes clusters with dedicated storage fabrics (Ceph) and high-throughput networking.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=kubernetes" class="disc-link">Inquire K8s Sourcing →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Business Continuity</span>
          <h2>Backup & Disaster Recovery</h2>
          <p>Cross-datacenter replication pipelines engineered around strict Recovery Point (RPO) and Recovery Time (RTO) objectives.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=dr" class="disc-link">Plan DR Architecture →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-cta">
        <h2>Evaluate Your Virtualization Migration</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?service=cloud" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Consult a Cloud Architect</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hub-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .hub-header { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 54px; }
  .hub-kicker { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent-blue); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hub-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 16px 0; }
  .hub-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .service-discovery-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .disc-pill { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .disc-link { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .disc-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .hub-cta { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 44px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px; }
</style>
